### MyCrypto FastAPI v2.0 - API Testing
### Base URL: http://localhost:8000

### Health Check
GET http://localhost:8000/health
Accept: application/json

###

### Root Endpoint
GET http://localhost:8000/
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### USER ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create User
POST http://localhost:8000/users/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "name": "Test User",
  "password": "securepassword123"
}

###

### Get All Users
GET http://localhost:8000/users/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Users with Pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/users/?skip=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get User by ID (replace with actual ID from create response)
GET http://localhost:8000/users/{{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update User (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8000/users/{{user_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Updated Test User",
  "email": "updated@example.com"
}

###

### Get User by Email
GET http://localhost:8000/users/email/test@example.com
Accept: application/json

###

### Delete User (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/users/{{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### CRYPTO ASSETS ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create Crypto Asset
POST http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "BTC",
  "name": "Bitcoin",
  "current_price": 45000.00
}

###

### Create Multiple Crypto Assets
POST http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "ETH",
  "name": "Ethereum",
  "current_price": 3000.00
}

###

POST http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "ADA",
  "name": "Cardano",
  "current_price": 0.50
}

###

POST http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "symbol": "SOL",
  "name": "Solana",
  "current_price": 100.00
}

###

### Get All Crypto Assets
GET http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Crypto Assets with Pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/?skip=0&limit=5
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Crypto Asset by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/{{asset_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Crypto Asset by Symbol
GET http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/symbol/BTC
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Crypto Asset Price (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/{{asset_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "current_price": 46000.00
}

###

### Delete Crypto Asset (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/crypto-assets/{{asset_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### ========================================
### PORTFOLIO ENDPOINTS
### ========================================

### Create Portfolio Entry
POST http://localhost:8000/portfolio/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "asset_id": "{{asset_id}}",
  "quantity": 0.5,
  "purchase_price": 44000.00
}

###

### Create Another Portfolio Entry
POST http://localhost:8000/portfolio/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "user_id": "{{user_id}}",
  "asset_id": "{{eth_asset_id}}",
  "quantity": 2.0,
  "purchase_price": 2900.00
}

###

### Get All Portfolio Entries
GET http://localhost:8000/portfolio/
Accept: application/json

###

### Get All Portfolio Entries with Pagination
GET http://localhost:8000/portfolio/?skip=0&limit=10
Accept: application/json

###

### Get Portfolio Entry by ID (replace with actual ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/portfolio/{{portfolio_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Get User Portfolio (replace with actual user ID)
GET http://localhost:8000/portfolio/user/{{user_id}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Update Portfolio Entry (replace with actual ID)
PUT http://localhost:8000/portfolio/{{portfolio_id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "quantity": 0.75,
  "purchase_price": 45000.00
}

###

### Delete Portfolio Entry (replace with actual ID)
DELETE http://localhost:8000/portfolio/{{portfolio_id}}
Accept: application/json

###
